cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TSFEL in your work, please cite the publication below."
title: "TSFEL: Time Series Feature Extraction Library"
type: software
abstract: >-
  TSFEL is a Python library for time series feature extraction. It computes
  over 60 statistical, temporal, spectral and fractal features, and is used for
  time series classification, regression and signal processing.
